          "title": "You'll want to know: کنکور",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "کنکور (konkur) — \"the university entrance exam\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "برادرم برای کنکور درس میخواند. barâdaram barâye konkur dars mikhânad. My brother is studying for the entrance exam."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The national exam for university places in Iran."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "کنکور (konkur) was borrowed from French concours \"competition\" (EtymDB), from Latin concursus \"a running together\", built on currere \"to run\" (Lewis & Short)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
